{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20202",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.06,
      "end_seconds": 5.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Hello? Doctor? I was told to come in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.01,
      "end_seconds": 12.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.08,
      "end_seconds": 26.92,
      "duration_seconds": 12.84,
      "text": "I've been dealing with pain in the finger. I took the morning off to come in today. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.58,
      "end_seconds": 31.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.65,
      "end_seconds": 34.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Probably ten days. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.63,
      "end_seconds": 40.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.49,
      "end_seconds": 52.36,
      "duration_seconds": 10.87,
      "text": "Right, maybe a seven out of ten on a bad day. Honestly, a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.81,
      "end_seconds": 56.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.64,
      "end_seconds": 66.57,
      "duration_seconds": 7.93,
      "text": "Ah, when it starts I tend to get a numb fingertip as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.04,
      "end_seconds": 88.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "And what about dirt in the wound, pus, fever or bite?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.3,
      "end_seconds": 98.06,
      "duration_seconds": 7.76,
      "text": "Okay, so I haven't had dirt in the wound, pus, fever or bite, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.31,
      "end_seconds": 101.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.46,
      "end_seconds": 105.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.4,
      "end_seconds": 109.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.52,
      "end_seconds": 113.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.21,
      "end_seconds": 119.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.97,
      "end_seconds": 124.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Um, you know, not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.48,
      "end_seconds": 128.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.51,
      "end_seconds": 136.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "I, I have diabetes. I have depression, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.41,
      "end_seconds": 144.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "Alright, diabetes, that matches what I have here. Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.62,
      "end_seconds": 160.14,
      "duration_seconds": 14.52,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.9,
      "end_seconds": 167.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.35,
      "end_seconds": 172.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Fluoxetine. I take it 20 milligrams, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.2,
      "end_seconds": 177.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Okay, I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.84,
      "end_seconds": 191.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Right, keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.56,
      "end_seconds": 210.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.44,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 17, pulse 80, BP is 117 over 78. And saturation 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.62,
      "end_seconds": 216.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.98,
      "end_seconds": 219.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.08,
      "end_seconds": 240.21,
      "duration_seconds": 8.13,
      "text": "There is a two-centimetre clean cut over the first knuckle, the finger moves fully and the fingertip feels normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.7,
      "end_seconds": 246.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.78,
      "end_seconds": 268.72,
      "duration_seconds": 12.94,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, I don't have a clear answer today: a clean finger laceration without nerve or tendon injury is possible, and so is a tendon injury."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.42,
      "end_seconds": 274.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "Let me think, uh, is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.27,
      "end_seconds": 293.87,
      "duration_seconds": 17.6,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a clean finger laceration without nerve or tendon injury, and we'll know more once the an X-ray of the finger is back. Let's get an X-ray of the finger, for laceration."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.47,
      "end_seconds": 296.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.35,
      "end_seconds": 322.66,
      "duration_seconds": 24.31,
      "text": "The treatment will be tetanus booster, 0.5 ml, once, for one day. It's for tetanus prevention. Keep the dressing dry for two days and watch for redness or pus. If the wound becomes red, hot or swollen, that's the point to come in urgently. I'd like you back in five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.5,
      "end_seconds": 327.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "I'll book it on my way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.83,
      "end_seconds": 335.34,
      "duration_seconds": 7.51,
      "text": "Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.02,
      "end_seconds": 345.77,
      "duration_seconds": 9.75,
      "text": "So, I take the tetanus booster, 0.5 ml, once and come back in five days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.56,
      "end_seconds": 351.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 353.74,
      "end_seconds": 356.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Um, thank you, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.15,
      "end_seconds": 359.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}